<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχείρ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>undertaking, attempt,</i> esp. of a military
				<i>enterprise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανικὸν ἐ. ἐπιχειρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.113c
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὴ μωρία καὶ τοῦ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					317a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>base of operations against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ Κύπρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in the Logic
			of <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>, <i>attempted,</i> i.e. <i>dialectical proof,</i> opp. a
			demonstrative syllogism (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοσόφημα</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				162a16
			</span></i>, etc.: so in Rhet., [<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
			</span></i>]<i>ad Herenn.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Din.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Is.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				1055.18
			</span></i> F, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.221
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ -ημάτων,</span> title
			of work by Minucianus.</div>
